# Copy to .env. Expo reads EXPO_PUBLIC_* variables at start-up (restart `make start` after editing).
#
# The backend API, including /api/v1. Leave empty for the offline demo mode (no account, sample data).
#   phone on Wi-Fi:       http://<your computer's LAN address>:8079/api/v1
#   Android emulator:     http://10.0.2.2:8079/api/v1
#   iOS simulator / web:  http://localhost:8079/api/v1
EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=
